sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Request
    participant O as Observer
    participant I as Interpreter
    participant A as Authority Checker
    participant G as Admissibility Gate
    participant D as Decision Role
    participant Q as Receipt Issuer
    participant P as Return-Path Carrier
    participant W as Reconstruction Witness

    R->>O: transition_id, origin, return_path, action, actor, target, scope
    O->>I: observed request hash and source evidence
    I->>A: interpreted transition and missing-field status
    A->>G: authority standing result
    G->>D: admissibility standing result
    D->>Q: ALLOW, DENY, or FAIL_CLOSED
    Q->>P: decision plus receipt hash
    P->>W: governed return payload hash
    W-->>R: reconstruction evidence
